<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	  Deliberately empty for now.

	  The Xcode template shipped CloudKit + aps-environment. Neither applies:
	  Supabase is the backend (ARCHITECTURE.md §2), and the morning check-in
	  reminder is a LOCAL notification, which needs no entitlement.

	  Add aps-environment only when remote push is actually built — an unused
	  push entitlement fails signing against an App ID lacking the capability.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
